# Trial of the Challenger (Q211), the chest of Shyslassys: the key opens it on a draw of 2 or more out of 10 for
# 1 + draw out of 1000 adena (page 30647-02, no jackpot sound); on a draw under 2 it is the jackpot, whose
# tier is the next draw out of 100: over 90 the five patterns, over 70 the beads and the page, over 40 the
# white tunic pattern, else the iron boots design. Hand-written from the quest script (no reference trace).
character Challenger 36
class 1
quest Q211_TrialOfTheChallenger <cond>=2 <state>=STARTED
hold 2632 7
random 2 499 1 91 0 90 0 71 0 70 0 41 0 40
script quest.Q211_TrialOfTheChallenger
item 2632 57 1904 2030 1936 1940 1943 1946 2918 2927
page default/30647.htm
page script/quest/Q211_TrialOfTheChallenger/
npc chest 30647 Folk 10 0 0

# a miss of the 2-in-10 jackpot roll (draw 2) and 1 + draw 499 adena
action chest
action chest
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=chest item=0 page=default/30647.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{chest}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=chest item=0 page=script/quest/Q211_TrialOfTheChallenger/30647-01.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest Q211_TrialOfTheChallenger 30647-04.htm
